This isn't technically a death, but it is the stupidest and most
unfortunate thing I have ever witnessed in many years of hackery:

The version was 3.0. I was watching someone else play. It was a decent
game, reasonably deep into the dungeon, a good assortment of wands.
The best of them - a wand of fire, I think - was bound to the inventory
letter Q. At one point, something powerful appeared due northwest of
the player. He rapidly banged in the key sequence for zapping his best
wand at it. Unfortunately, he slipped and hit the 'x' key along with
the 'z' for zap. Since x was not a wand:
What a strange thing to zap!
Really quit? (yn)
Goodbye...

And there was nothing he could do about it since it was just reacting
to keys he had already pressed.

